<p>The net income per share and number of shares used in the per-share calculation for all periods presented reflect the two-for-one stock split which was effective February 16, 1996.</p>
<p>Latest Q1 net income includes an after-tax charge of $0.26 per share for the writeoff of in-process R&amp;D, and a pre-tax gain of $0.05 per share from the sale of a portion of a minority stock investment.</p>
